  "content": "Devo vassatu kālena, sassa-sampatti hetu ca.Phīto bhavatu loko ca, rājā bhavatu dhammiko.Imāya Buddha-pūjāya katāya suddha-cetasā,Ciraṃ tiṭṭhatu Saddhammo, loko hotu sukhī sadā.Imāya Dhamma-pūjāya katāya suddha-cetasā,Ciraṃ tiṭṭhatu Saddhammo, loko hotu sukhī sadā.Imāya Saṅgha-pūjāya katāya suddha-cetasā,Ciraṃ tiṭṭhatu Saddhammo, loko hotu sukhī sadā.",
